WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.410
Some Muslims are Sunni and some are Shi'a.

2
00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:06.950
They follow different
schools, leaders and customs.

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.980
Across the world, Muslims live in many
countries and speak many languages.

4
00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:15.060
Yet the Prophet compared
believers to one body:

5
00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:18.410
when one part hurts,
the whole body feels it.

6
00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:22.570
So can people who are this
different really be one community?

7
00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:27.340
In this mission, you'll read what the
Qur'an says about nations and tribes.

8
00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:29.930
Then you'll weigh up what divides Muslims,

9
00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:33.060
and what many Muslims do
to heal those divisions.

10
00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:38.190
Your mission: find out what could make
so many different people one community.
